    "long_instructions": "**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Under `# TODO: Training`, create and fit your model.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nRemember you can use `LinearRegression` to create a linear regression model.\r\n\r\n```\r\nmodel = LinearRegression()\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd you can use `model.fit` to fit your model.\r\n\r\n```\r\nmodel.fit(train_inputs, train_outputs)\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can then call `print_linear_model` to see your model’s equation.\r\n\r\n```\r\nprint_linear_model(model)\r\n```",
